#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:5
msgid "Display folio properties"
msgstr "显示光圈属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:7
msgid ""
"The `folio properties`_ can be common at all `folios`_ from the same "
"`project`_. QElectroTech also allows that each `folio`_ has its own "
"properties. For example, two `folios`_ can be created by different authors "
"or they can have different revision item."
msgstr ""
"`follios <folio properties_>`_ 属性完全可以常见于同一 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 中的 `项目 "
"<project_>`_。QElectroTech 也允许每个 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 拥有自己的属性，例如，两个 `图幅 <folios_>`_"
" 可以由不同的作者创建，也可以有不同的修订项。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:14
msgid ""
"To reduce the creation time, QElectroTech allows creating some pre-setting "
"for all future `folios`_ that will be created at the `project`_. For more "
"information about how to pre-define `folio properties`_, refer to `project "
"properties`_ section."
msgstr ""
"为了缩短创建时间，QElectroTech 允许在 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 上为未来所有 `项目 <project_>`_ "
"创建一些预设。有关如何预先定义 `folio属性 <folio properties_>`_ 的更多信息，请参考 `project polity "
"<project properties_>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:18
msgid ""
"The folio properties window can be displayed from `menu bar`_, `workspace`_,"
" `toolbar`_, `projects panel`_, `folios tabs bar`_ and using the "
"corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"folio属性窗口可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_，`工作区 <workspace_>`_，`工具栏 <toolbar_>`_，`项目面板 "
"<projects panel_>`_，`follios tabs bar <folios tabs bar_>`_ 显示，并使用相应的键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:22
msgid "Display folio properties from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏显示光滑属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:24
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Folio properties** menu item to display `folio properties`_ "
"from the active `folio`_."
msgstr ""
"选择 **Edit > Folio 属性** 菜单项从活动 `folio <folio properties_>`_ 中显示 `图幅 "
"<folio_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:29
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:32
msgid "Display folio properties from workspace"
msgstr "从工作空间显示光圈属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:34
msgid ""
"Right click on the `workspace`_ area. Should be somewhere without any "
"`element`_, `conductor`_, `table`_, etc."
msgstr ""
"右键点击 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 区域。 应该在没有 `元件 <element_>`_，`导体 "
"<conductor_>`_，`table <table_>`_ 等的地方 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:35
msgid ""
"Click the option **Folio properties** to display `folio properties`_ from "
"the active `folio`_."
msgstr ""
"单击选项 **Folio 属性** 从活动 `folio <folio properties_>`_ 显示 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:40
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Workspace Menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 工作空间菜单"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:43
msgid "Display folio properties from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏显示软体属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:45
msgid ""
"Select the icon |dialog-information| from `toolbar`_ to display `folio "
"properties`_ from the active `folio`_."
msgstr ""
"从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中选择图标 |dialog-information| 以显示活动 `follio <folio "
"properties_>`_ 中的 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:47
msgid "dialog-information"
msgstr "对话框信息"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:51
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Diagram**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 没有显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 图表** 中显示。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:54
msgid "Display folio properties from projects panel"
msgstr "从项目面板显示光滑属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:56
msgid ""
"Right click on the `folio`_ where any property should be defined, it can be "
"an inactive `folio`_ from an inactive `project`_."
msgstr ""
"右键点击应当定义任何属性的 `图幅 <folio_>`_，它可以是非活动 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 从非活动 `项目 <project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:57
msgid ""
"Click the option **Folio properties** to display `folio properties`_ from "
"the selected `folio`_."
msgstr ""
"单击选项 **Folio 属性** 从选中的 `folio <folio properties_>`_ 显示 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:62
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Project panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech项目面板"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:66
msgid ""
"If the `projects panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Projects**"
msgstr "如果 `项目面板 <projects panel_>`_ 没有显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 项目** 显示"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:69
msgid "Display folio properties from folios tabs bar"
msgstr "从 folios 标签栏显示 folio 属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:71
msgid "Double click on the `folio tab`_ to display `folio properties`_."
msgstr "双击 `follio tab <folio tab_>`_ 显示 `follio 属性 <folio properties_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:76
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech folio tabs bar"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech folio 标签栏"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:79
msgid "Display folio properties using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键显示软体属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:81
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:83
msgid ""
"Press ``Ctrl + l`` to display `folio properties`_ from the active `folio`_."
msgstr ""
"按 ``Ctrl + l`` 显示 `follio 属性 <folio properties_>`_ 从活动 `图幅 <folio_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/display.rst:87
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
